{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "お久しぶりです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobusQ4mh.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobnPpNbi.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "リアルミート&グリートありがとうございました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/moboU2X4T.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobc7k25V.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobXuqRZW.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回も素敵な祝花ありがとうございます\nとっても嬉しいです~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobdoOPwL.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobdNg9NZ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "GIGA2026ありがとうございました~\n久しぶりのフェス楽しかったです！暑かったね~🥱"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobBUjr0Z.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "少し遅くなってしまいましたが、😢\n音楽の日　DREAMダンス企画ありがとうございました！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "坂道グループ選抜として、皆さんと一緒に協力し合いながらパフォーマンスさせていただく機会はあまり無かった為、沢山学び吸収させていただきました！　楽しかったです　皆さんありがとうございました！！！＾＾"}, {"type": "break"}, {"t